    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a Customer Success Manager at n8n covering EMEA enterprise accounts.\n\nAccount: {{ $json.account_name }} ({{ $json.plan }} plan, EUR {{ $json.arr_eur }} ARR)\nHealth score: {{ $json.health_score }}/100 ({{ $json.health_tier }})\nSeat adoption: {{ $json.adoption_rate_pct }}% of {{ $json.seats_purchased }} seats active in the last 30 days\nWorkflow executions (30 days): {{ $json.executions_30d }} (change vs. previous 30 days: {{ $json.usage_trend_pct }}%)\nSupport tickets (30 days): {{ $json.support_tickets_30d }}\nDays since last CSM contact: {{ $json.days_since_contact }}\nDays to renewal: {{ $json.days_to_renewal }}\nRisk drivers: {{ $json.risk_drivers }}\nChampion: {{ $json.champion_name }}\n\nWrite three sections in English, plain text, no markdown symbols:\nRISK SUMMARY: two sentences in business language on why this account is at risk and what is at stake commercially.\nNEXT ACTION: one concrete action for this week and the goal of that conversation.\nCHECK-IN EMAIL: a warm email to the champion, max 110 words. Do not mention scores or internal metrics. Offer a 30-minute workflow review and suggest one specific automation idea linked to the risk drivers.",
        "batching": {}
      },
